# Test suite: a small, hand-made set of individuals that exercises every
# competency question and every shape. Fictional records, realistic codes.
# krim:stateAsOf is when the publisher reported the state we hold (the latest one).
# Each record lists its types as the publisher does: a type plus all broader types.
# Each record lies in a real anonymisation area of the publisher's list (ids and
# centres as published); the areas are at the end of the file. Municipalities come
# from the reference data (ČSÚ codelist 43).

